msgid "plugins.generic.doajPreAssessment.displayName"
msgstr "DOAJ Pre-Assessment"

msgid "plugins.generic.doajPreAssessment.description"
msgstr "Independent, backend-only self-assessment of a journal's public website before an initial DOAJ application. Not an official DOAJ evaluation; it does not predict or guarantee acceptance. Development build: assessment rules are not yet implemented. ENGLISH-ONLY JOURNAL CONTENT: this plugin evaluates only publicly accessible English-language journal websites, uses deterministic rules (no Artificial Intelligence or automatic translation), and this limitation applies to the plugin, not to DOAJ eligibility."

